+          "type": "list_item",
+          "text": "4. A"
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "travelogue of a resident of Brooklyn (community in Baltimore) and his ordeal of trying to use buses to get home after attending a football game in the city.[4]"
