+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "Cybercrime: Cybercrime encompasses a wide range of criminal activities that are carried out using digital devices and/or networks."
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "Cybersecurity Incident: A single (or a series of) unwanted or unexpected computer security events that have a significant probability of compromising business operations and threatening cybersecurity."
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
