+          "text": "Viduneth Ariyarathna, Arjuna Madanayake, Xinyao Tang, Diego Coelho, et al, Analog Approximate-FFT 8/16-Beam Algorithms, Architectures and CMOS Circuits for 5G Beamforming MIMO Transceivers, IEEE Journal on Emerging and Selected Topics in Circuits and Systems, vol. 8, no. 3, pp. 466-479, 2018. DOI: 10.1109/JETCAS.2018.2832177."
+        },
