+        {
+          "type": "heading",
+          "text": "10、碳达峰与碳中和",
+          "level": 2
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "基于Kaya模型，有如下关系："
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "CO2=P * GDP/P * E/GDP * CO2/E"
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "式中，CO2是二氧化碳排放量；P是人口；GDP/P是人均GDP；E/GDP是单位"
