+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "should be closely coordinated because water outflows from the Glen Canyon dam supply part of the water input to the Hoover dam."
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "list_item",
+          "text": "• The challenge presented by this series configuration of two dams is to determine a"
+        },
