+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "Requirements In developing your water allocation plan according to the negotiators’ guidance, you should:"
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "list_item",
+          "text": "• Develop and analyze a mathematical model that will assist negotiators to respond to a"
