+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "fixed set of water supply and demand conditions. Use the model to inform dam operations: When the water level in Lake Mead is M and the water level in Lake Powell is P, how much water should be drawn from each lake to meet stated demands? If no additional water is supplied (from rainfall, etc.), and considering the demands as fixed, how long will it take before the demands are not met? How much additional water must be supplied over time to ensure that these fixed demands are met?"
