+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "next decade. Project what equipment cost increases will occur assuming the cost of drone systems stays constant."
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "list_item",
+          "text": "3. Determine a model for optimizing the locations of hovering VHF/UHF radio-repeater drones"
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "for fires of different sizes on different terrains such as those shown in Figure 2: Topographical Map of Eastern Victoria. Note that elevations range from sea level at the coast to 1,986 meters at Mt. Bogong, Victoria."
+        },
+        {
+          "type": "list_item",
+          "text": "4. Prepare a one- to two-page annotated Budget Request supported by your models for CFA to"
+        },
