+        },
+        {
+          "type": "paragraph",
+          "text": "Your PDF solution of no more than 25 total pages should include:  One-page Summary Sheet.  Table of Contents.  Your complete solution.  One- to two-page annotated Budget Request.  References list."
+        },
+        {
